pages.text:
Announcements keeps the notices of a workspace in one place: planned maintenance, outages, new releases.

To show the current ones in another application, let its database role read them (once, in SQL Commands or a migration script):

grant usage on schema announcements to app_my_app;
grant select on announcements.announcement to app_my_app;

Then add a Cards region (or a list) to its home page with this query:

select title, kind as subtitle, body from announcements.announcement where published and current_date between start_date and coalesce(end_date, start_date) and audience in ('Everyone', 'Developers') order by start_date desc
